{"info":{"name":"BMA-56 계정 API (S8 로그아웃·회원탈퇴·비밀번호 변경)","description":"S8 마이페이지 계정 API 검증 컬렉션 (BMA-56).\n\n내 계정 요약(S8-08: nickname/loginProvider/passwordSet), 비밀번호 변경(S8-16: 현재 비밀번호 검증·규칙·세션 정리), 로그아웃(S8-14: 리프레시 토큰 폐기), 회원 탈퇴(S8-15: 매칭 종료·상대 알림·채팅방 ENDED·익명화·재가입 가능)를 순서대로 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다.\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n\n검증 항목: 프로필 요약 필드, AUTH_015/COMMON_001/401, 비밀번호 변경 후 옛 RT·옛 비밀번호 거부, 로그아웃 후 RT 거부, 탈퇴 후 로그인·RT 거부·USER_001, 상대의 hasMatch=false·MATCH_ENDED 알림·ENDED 방·partner null, 같은 이메일·닉네임 재사용.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정과 새 닉네임을 쓴다. 반복 실행해도 깨지지 않게 한다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"acct-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"acct-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickA\", \"계정A\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickB\", \"계정B\" + (t % 100000));"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", d.accessToken); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshA\", d.refreshToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. 내 계정 - 프로필 요약 (S8-08): 닉네임 null, LOCAL, passwordSet","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"email, nickname=null, loginProvider=LOCAL, passwordSet=true, ACTIVE\", () => { pm.expect(d.email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"emailA\")); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"nickname\", null); pm.expect(d.loginProvider).to.eql(\"LOCAL\"); pm.expect(d.passwordSet).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.userStatus).to.eql(\"ACTIVE\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me"]}}},{"name":"4. 프로필 A 저장","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickA}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"5. 내 계정 - 닉네임 반영","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"nickname\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.nickname).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"nickA\")));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me",